<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-18912] migrate struct import bit fields to bitmap</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18912</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In many places in the ptlrpc layer we are taking a spin lock to read a single bit. We can remove the need for these spin_locks by using bitmap with the various atomic bitops the kernel provides. This avoids potential might_sleep issues since often the ptlrpc code is run in an atomic context.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>The ptlrpc layer.</environment>
